<h2>3. Free trial</h2>
<p>New cloud servers start with a 14-day free trial. No credit card is required and nothing is charged automatically when the trial ends. If you have not subscribed by then, the server stops and its data may be deleted — see section 6.</p>

<h2>4. Subscription and billing</h2>
<ul>
    <li>One flat price per cloud server covers unlimited users and unlimited businesses on that server.</li>
    <li>You can pay monthly or annually, in advance. The annual price is ten times the monthly price.</li>
    <li>Payments are processed by Stripe and charged automatically to your payment method each period until you cancel. Prices exclude any taxes that apply where you are.</li>
